ape when no encoding is forced and the locale (LC_ALL, else LC_CTYPE, else LANG) is C or POSIX, as the"] [166 1 "// coerced C locale's. An unset locale keeps strict (pyi has no coercion to model)."] [227 1 "// writeStr is TextIOWrapper.write's encoding: utf-8 with strict errors as before, else the codec of PYTHONIOENCODING"] [228 1 "// and the stream's errors handler (a UnicodeEncodeError for an error left strict)."] [244 1 "// The site module's exit and quit (site.py's Quitter; _sitebuiltins): calling one raises SystemExit(code)."] [274 1 "// startOrigArgv is sys.orig_argv: bin/pyi python passes the executable and its command line in PYI_ORIG_ARGV (joined"] [275 1 "// by the unit separator), read once and removed from the environment."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[44 12] [44 25] [82 57] [103 60] [112 54] [120 64] [125 65] [140 34] [145 7] [145 30] [151 39] [183 41]]} (go/file "builtins_sys_info.go" :imports [


